hen Nick Chubb is  running the football efficiently which  is something that they can do because  Nick job is a special player all of a  sudden OBJ's not getting as much  coverage as he was before and now we can  throw him the football now we can get  him involve  and then it's much easier when you have  a simplified offense to take care of  those details and to play consistently  good football and I think that's what  we'll see coming out of the bye week if  you could block for any quarterback now  it would it be  I would love to puck for Russell Wilson  like I mentioned earlier he makes  everybody on that team better Patrick  Holmes he would be a lot of fun too it's  hard it's hard to argue between those  two but I just feel like Russell Wilson  with his experience and his  decision-making not only in the pocket  but when he starts to run and his  ability to understand when it's time to  scramble and when it's time to scramble  and make an unbelievable throw and the  fact that he's playing flawless football  nearly completing almost 75% of his  passes throwing the ball down the field  and just finding a way to win I think it  would be fun to play with them because  as much fun as it is to have the  starwars offense in Kansas City and  score 40 or 50 points to me the exciting  thing about playing in the NFL is  finding a new way to win every week and  when you have a quarterback like Russell  Wilson that's exactly what he's doing  because you're never in a game where  you're saying okay it's over or we don't  have a chance you're always looking and  saying Russell Wilson is our guy we're  gonna win this game great to talk to you  Joe's safe travels to Denver and we  appreciate your time I appreciate it  thanks for having me on dance but let's  show Thomas NFL Network analyst for more  Dan Patrick show tune in the audience  channel 239 on DirecTV stream for free  on be our live or download the Dan  Patrick show app  [Music]

